  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>tr_process_robot_data - the child: runs once for each batch of robot readings.

1. Get records from stream: the batch, one field, message (String).
2. Get system info: current_time, system date (fixed) - one time for the whole batch.
3. JSON input: source is the field message; temperature ($.temperature) and
   position ($.position), both String.
4. Text file output: appends to robot_sensor.txt beside this file, ; separated,
   no header: current_time, temperature, position.

Run by tr_robot_consumer.ktr: about five lines a batch, a batch every 5 seconds.</note>
